msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Let's get you home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu! You better apologize!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "I can only imagine how much you had to get this drunk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hic... Hic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Feeling a little better now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Why do bad things aaaalways happen to me? Say you're sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "...I'm sorry I wasn't there with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I... I'm sorry, Kazuma Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Huh? Yui..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I'm, I'm sorry, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Thanks, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I'm not really sure what happened, but it looks like I can actually "
"apologize to people in person now. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "You're welcome, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Do I look cute when I'm apologizing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Definitely. I've never seen you look this cute, ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "So, will you take me on a date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "...You really want to hit the town again after all that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Of course! After all, I've got to show you just how grateful I am that you "
"came to rescue me today... <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

